in 2–5 `defn` entry points (`yang.core.semantics`: `validate-descriptor`, `capability-status`, `literal-node`, `hook-symbol`, `resolve-ambient`), and guest `yrt.*` modules bound their public export count cleanly (gr\n803:| **P0 — Uniform composition plumbing & `defquoted` consolidation** | Consolidate `defquoted` into `yang.core.prelude`; implement `:yang.prelude/recipe` (with independent `:components`, explicit `:trailing-requires`, uniform `:finalize-c1? true`) / `:yang.prelude/\n805:| **P2 — Lowering parameterization (`yang.core.semantics` + frontend contracts)** | Implement generic `yang.core.semantics` with UAST-derived arity & role validation against verified `:yin.module/tree` (`artifact-store`); define frontend contracts (Python, TypeScr\n807:| **P4 — Tier-2 shared modules & symmetric cross-frontend swapping** | Extract parameterized `yrt.gen` (preserving Python `:base` rebasing vs. PHP direct context restoration and refcount cleanup) and `yrt.safepoint` (`stream/poll!` skeleton for `pysp`/`jssp`); exe\n814:   - *Option A (Recommended — Architect concurred):* `:mutation/locals :cell` (task-heap cells holding pure persistent Clojure values, matching Python parameter binding, unbound reads, reassignment, loops, and `nonlocal` with per-module `globals` cells). Keep `:si\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
